q: title: Will Elon Musk create a new political party by July 4?, description: This market will resolve to "Yes" if Elon Musk publicly announces the formation of a new political party by July 4, 2025, 11:59 PM ET. Otherwise, this market will resolve to "No". 

The announcement must be explicit and clearly state that the new political party is being launched or formed. Statements merely expressing support for the idea of a new party, or alignment with specific political ideologies or other statements which do not constitute the official launch of a new political party will not qualify. 

The resolution will be based on a consensus of credible reporting. market_id: 558619 res_data: p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to No, p2 to Yes, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x6A9D222616C90FcA5754cd1333cFD9b7fb6a4F74 as described by https://polygonscan.com/tx/0xa14f01b115c4913624fc3f508f960f4dea252758e73c28f5f07f8e19d7bca066 should be considered.,initializer:91430cad2d3975766499717fa0d66a78d814e5c5,ooRequester:157ce2d672854c848c9b79c49a8cc6cc89176a49